      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `0aad5cc9a5e33ac1556070825d4398c33970a0de295da7dec80814432cbfb9b4--1.-Victims-of-crime-Australia-Tables-1-to-8-.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2021\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 9 of 9\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 131367101d28a90eb601b032ec92dcb9d7473d858f635056440b618c95eeaae9 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | f31f88de75b4d477744db4b04b8ee0a3a73b3482bb69e3b40db7efdb3afa5236 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | ace0ad2f40276b53264e646d72b433579d59ee52770eae4fd5a8fb510ec80483 | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | af028ef92f485358e38993697d76d6a10cde0ddb055ffe25eecf8fd2cf6455d5 | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | c74668172a2d244d61f1d3b235d2b3ef9c46e1d6bbeb8c2f0c1eee44f90d161b | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | 53ba428effcc08a49fd3fd5ba10003e02bece4a7bd0367e679c6a5685a7deff2 | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | 5e1d7c6f901bf6c0ba8d6aa8768baf0f8543671dd666c7b2934611d69752c63b | missing |\n| \"Table 7\" | 2572be2e0dd2af78b563f3ed384be6e6d6bb981a9e20862c7b94c67319a7dd8e | missing |\n| \"Table 8\" | 4192784e5ac0c56b7f27d1fefd697ba7116dd68dc56be99489038f1cdd22c21c | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
